yle=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #000099; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">졸업논문(전공시험포함) 및 졸업외국어 불합격자 등 제외</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 110.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -110.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ </font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">졸업 외국어 자격인정 서류(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">2차 기간 : 2013.01.28.(월)～01.31.(목)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">제출 및 계절학기 학점취득으로 졸업 가능한 자 등 포함</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. <strong>신청기간 :&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">2013.01.14.(월)~01.15.(화)</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 교무처 학사관리팀 방문 신청[본관 201호]</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 신청서류 : 졸업유예신청서 1부</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">3. <strong>등록기간 :&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">2013.01.17.(목)~01.18.(금) [농협]</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷고지서 출력 : 원스톱서비스-등록금 고지내역 조회</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 등록금액 : 기성회비의 1/6 해당액</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. 유의사항</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">① </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">졸업유예 등록금을 납부 완료하여야 졸업유예 신청이 완료</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">됩니다.</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;② 등록금 인상에 따른 차액(인상분) 발생시 추가로 등록금을 납부 완료하여야 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 졸업유예신청이 완료됩니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;③ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">2013학년도 1학기 수강을 희망하는 자는 수강신청 기간내에 수강신청을 한 후</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">등록금을 납부하면 됩니다. </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 수업연한 초과자 기준으로 등록금을 납부하되, 기납부금액에서 차액만 납부하면 됩니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;④ 재학연한 범위내에서 가능하며, 최대 4회까지 신청가능합니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 1회 신청→한 학기만 신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 재학연한 : 6년(건축학전공 7년)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp; </p><hr style=\"BORDER-TOP: black 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: black; BORDER-BOTTOM-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: black; HEIGHT: 1px; BORDER-RIGHT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: black\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: 